BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Disappeared in America Visibility Event - West Sacramento (1st Wed
 nesday)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T090000
UID:2fd4ee51963362c24c4448420b6604c6@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/disappeared_20250831215834320714.png
DESCRIPTION:In America\, the government doesn’t get to grab people off t
 he streets\, skip the courtroom\, and send them straight to a foreign pris
 on. Disappeared in America is a Yolo County day of action to stand up for 
 the rule of law and confront the Trump administration’s illegal abductio
 ns\, detentions\, and deportations of people like Kilmar Abrego Garcia\, R
 ui Marras\, and Juan Maldonado Zuniga. 🚨 On the 1st Wednesday of the mo
 nth\, we’re showing up in West Sacramento at the corner of Jefferson Blv
 d. and Park
LOCATION:Corner of  Jefferson Blvd. and Park Blvd.\, West Sacramento\, CA\
 , 95691
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/877694/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
